      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_CRUISE - &lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_COMMAND_ABBREV&lt;/color&gt;/$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_ARAD_PULSED_ABBREV(&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;) - $MISSILEWARHEAD_SHORT_HEIMPACT</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-H-303 Atlatl 4&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 3 waypoint-capable cruise missile.  It is based on the SGM-H-3 body, which is a high speed hybrid missile designed to strike heavy targets.  This missile will deliver a Contact Fuze, High Explosive, Shaped warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Radar Anti-Radiation seeker.

$MISSILESTAT_CONTROLMETHOD: $MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_CRUISE_LONG
$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE: &lt;b&gt;&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_POS&lt;/color&gt;	&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRACK[+$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRP]&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/b&gt;

$MISSILESTAT_PRIMARYSEEKER: $MISSILESEEKER_MODE_COMMAND_CAPS (&lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;$MISSILESEEKER_COMMAND_COMMSNOTE&lt;/color&gt;)
$MISSILESTAT_BACKUPSEEKER: ANTI-RADIATION (All &lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt; Signals)

&lt;b&gt;$MISSILEENGINE_STAGE_CRUISE|Cruise|&lt;/b&gt;
$MISSILESTAT_SPEED: 185 $UNIT_METERSPERSEC
$MISSILESTAT_DISTANCE: 14,561 $UNIT_METERS
